1
00:01:00,960 --> 00:01:01,560
Follow me.

2
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:03,930
Search the city.

3
00:01:04,120 --> 00:01:04,760
Yes, sir.

4
00:01:09,200 --> 00:01:10,730
Sir, there is nothing here.

5
00:01:11,320 --> 00:01:11,800
Move.

6
00:01:12,440 --> 00:01:12,960
Next.

7
00:01:13,120 --> 00:01:15,250
What are they searching for this time?

8
00:01:16,520 --> 00:01:17,360
What are you looking at?

9
00:01:17,360 --> 00:01:18,039
Get inside.

10
00:01:21,760 --> 00:01:22,360
After him!

11
00:01:22,640 --> 00:01:23,760
Go!

12
00:01:24,160 --> 00:01:24,640
Halt!

13
00:01:24,800 --> 00:01:25,330
This way!

14
00:01:27,800 --> 00:01:28,240
Halt!

15
00:01:45,520 --> 00:01:47,120
General, please take a look.

16
00:01:52,640 --> 00:01:54,970
So they pass messages through paintings.

17
00:02:14,800 --> 00:02:15,960
Search the premises.

18
00:02:15,960 --> 00:02:16,490
Yes, sir.

19
00:02:17,360 --> 00:02:18,160
General Ning,

20
00:02:19,640 --> 00:02:20,700
What are you doing?

21
00:02:25,960 --> 00:02:26,960
General, look.

22
00:02:29,920 --> 00:02:30,520
Seize him.

23
00:02:31,200 --> 00:02:31,730
Yes, sir.

24
00:02:39,120 --> 00:02:39,650
General,

25
00:02:45,640 --> 00:02:47,100
Do not touch my paintings.

26
00:03:01,200 --> 00:03:01,840
Stop!

27
00:03:03,800 --> 00:03:04,530
Ning Yuanci,

28
00:03:04,680 --> 00:03:06,000
on what grounds do you arrest him?

29
00:03:06,000 --> 00:03:06,680
Our general

30
00:03:06,720 --> 00:03:08,600
suspects he is a spy
colluding with the enemy.

31
00:03:08,600 --> 00:03:09,600
This deer totem

32
00:03:09,920 --> 00:03:10,850
is the evidence.

33
00:03:13,440 --> 00:03:14,170
Impossible!

34
00:03:14,200 --> 00:03:15,360
This is clearly Xue...
The innocent need no defense.

35
00:03:15,360 --> 00:03:16,090
Lady Keying,

36
00:03:16,320 --> 00:03:17,880
you need not waste your words on him.

37
00:03:17,880 --> 00:03:19,160
Under the Emperor's watch,

38
00:03:19,160 --> 00:03:21,200
how could I be falsely accused by him?

39
00:03:21,200 --> 00:03:22,079
Chu Qingjun,

40
00:03:22,200 --> 00:03:23,960
he just doesn't want
to implicate Xue Ruowan.

41
00:03:23,960 --> 00:03:24,680
Take him away.

42
00:03:24,680 --> 00:03:25,079
Yes.

43
00:03:25,400 --> 00:03:26,079
Move.

44
00:03:27,160 --> 00:03:27,680
Move.

45
00:03:28,200 --> 00:03:28,720
Behave.

46
00:03:42,640 --> 00:03:43,840
Bad news, Xue Ruowan.

47
00:03:44,400 --> 00:03:45,520
Chu Qingyun has been captured

48
00:03:45,520 --> 00:03:46,380
by Ning Yuanci.

49
00:03:46,680 --> 00:03:47,720
Let's go save him.

50
00:03:49,680 --> 00:03:51,000
The painting of Nirvana of the Phoenix

51
00:03:51,000 --> 00:03:52,600
that Chu Qingyun restored for you,

52
00:03:52,600 --> 00:03:53,560
Ning Yuanci insists

53
00:03:53,560 --> 00:03:55,020
it's evidence of treason.

54
00:03:55,720 --> 00:03:56,640
How could that painting

55
00:03:56,640 --> 00:03:58,200
be evidence of treason?

56
00:03:59,600 --> 00:04:00,560
Ning Yuanci said

57
00:04:00,960 --> 00:04:01,760
there's a deer totem

58
00:04:01,760 --> 00:04:03,000
on the canvas

59
00:04:03,240 --> 00:04:04,680
related to Northern spies.

60
00:04:04,680 --> 00:04:05,560
Was that totem

61
00:04:05,960 --> 00:04:07,020
originally there?

62
00:04:07,520 --> 00:04:09,320
I have no impression of it at all.

63
00:04:16,839 --> 00:04:18,100
Forget it. Never mind.

64
00:04:18,200 --> 00:04:18,680
Anyway, come with me

65
00:04:18,680 --> 00:04:20,279
to explain it to Ning Yuanci.

66
00:04:20,519 --> 00:04:23,040
Just say the painting
belongs to your mother,

67
00:04:23,040 --> 00:04:24,280
and it has absolutely nothing to do

68
00:04:24,280 --> 00:04:25,480
with Northern spies.

69
00:04:26,240 --> 00:04:26,770
Let's go.

70
00:04:27,080 --> 00:04:28,160
I won't go with you.

71
00:04:28,560 --> 00:04:30,120
That painting is not my mother's.

72
00:04:30,120 --> 00:04:31,520
And I never asked Chu Qingyun

73
00:04:31,520 --> 00:04:33,200
to restore any painting for me.

74
00:04:33,200 --> 00:04:34,130
What do you mean?

75
00:04:34,800 --> 00:04:36,600
Are you going to leave him to die?

76
00:04:36,960 --> 00:04:38,360
Have you figured out

77
00:04:38,640 --> 00:04:40,080
what Ning Yuanci's purpose is?

78
00:04:40,080 --> 00:04:41,159
I advise you not to be

79
00:04:41,159 --> 00:04:42,200
so self-righteous,

80
00:04:42,200 --> 00:04:44,400
lest you cause an even bigger disaster.

81
00:04:44,880 --> 00:04:46,080
Me, self-righteous?

82
00:04:49,240 --> 00:04:51,360
To make you look like
the strong female lead,

83
00:04:51,360 --> 00:04:52,560
I had to play

84
00:04:52,720 --> 00:04:54,080
the vain villainess,

85
00:04:54,960 --> 00:04:56,640
and cruelly hurt Ning Yuanci,

86
00:04:57,720 --> 00:04:58,560
making him mistakenly think

87
00:04:58,560 --> 00:04:59,690
I liked Chu Qingyun.

88
00:05:00,240 --> 00:05:02,560
That's why he's taking personal revenge.

89
00:05:02,560 --> 00:05:03,290
Ultimately,

90
00:05:03,600 --> 00:05:05,060
this is all because of you.

91
00:05:05,440 --> 00:05:06,200
You mean

92
00:05:06,920 --> 00:05:08,680
Ning Yuanci went to all this trouble

93
00:05:08,680 --> 00:05:09,480
for you?

94
00:05:09,720 --> 00:05:11,520
You're way too full of yourself.

95
00:05:11,720 --> 00:05:13,280
You think you can just go to him,

96
00:05:13,280 --> 00:05:14,240
say a few words,

97
00:05:14,520 --> 00:05:16,440
and make him go soft?

98
00:05:17,000 --> 00:05:17,720
Xue Keying,

99
00:05:18,440 --> 00:05:19,720
to him,

100
00:05:20,080 --> 00:05:21,000
you're nothing but a pawn

101
00:05:21,000 --> 00:05:22,600
to be used.

102
00:05:23,040 --> 00:05:24,400
Even if you're right,

103
00:05:25,280 --> 00:05:26,610
what about Chu Qingyun?

104
00:05:27,040 --> 00:05:28,570
He is completely innocent.

105
00:05:28,680 --> 00:05:30,480
Chu Qingyun looked out for you,

106
00:05:30,760 --> 00:05:31,920
yet you immediately

107
00:05:32,000 --> 00:05:32,880
cut ties with him

108
00:05:32,880 --> 00:05:34,140
just to save yourself.

109
00:05:34,320 --> 00:05:35,040
Xue Ruowan,

110
00:05:35,960 --> 00:05:37,090
you are too selfish.

111
00:05:37,640 --> 00:05:39,480
And to think I saved you
time and time again.

112
00:05:39,480 --> 00:05:40,360
Without me,

113
00:05:40,440 --> 00:05:42,700
you would have died a hundred times over.

114
00:05:46,120 --> 00:05:47,200
You did save me,

115
00:05:47,680 --> 00:05:48,680
but so what?

116
00:05:49,120 --> 00:05:50,120
Just because you saved me,

117
00:05:50,120 --> 00:05:52,080
do I have to obey you

118
00:05:52,640 --> 00:05:53,960
and live your way?

119
00:05:54,400 --> 00:05:55,760
If one cannot protect oneself,

120
00:05:55,760 --> 00:05:57,290
how can one protect others?

121
00:05:57,680 --> 00:05:59,640
When you're in trouble,
Father protects you.

122
00:05:59,640 --> 00:06:01,760
I can only protect myself.

123
00:06:02,560 --> 00:06:03,760
I originally thought

124
00:06:04,920 --> 00:06:06,680
you were willing to risk your life

125
00:06:06,680 --> 00:06:08,080
for freedom,

126
00:06:08,720 --> 00:06:09,920
and would rather die than go against

127
00:06:09,920 --> 00:06:10,760
your heart.

128
00:06:11,360 --> 00:06:12,120
I thought you knew better than me

129
00:06:12,120 --> 00:06:13,450
how to protect the weak.

130
00:06:14,880 --> 00:06:15,760
Now it seems

131
00:06:19,080 --> 00:06:20,880
I thought too highly of you.

132
00:06:23,640 --> 00:06:24,720
Why should I be a

133
00:06:24,720 --> 00:06:25,720
perfect person?

134
00:06:26,320 --> 00:06:28,400
Why must I sacrifice myself

135
00:06:29,000 --> 00:06:30,880
to get everything I want?

136
00:06:33,320 --> 00:06:35,159
I just need to marry Ning Yuanci

137
00:06:35,600 --> 00:06:36,320
to get

138
00:06:36,360 --> 00:06:38,200
endless wealth and

139
00:06:38,320 --> 00:06:39,440
Father's favor.

140
00:06:40,520 --> 00:06:42,520
Don't even think about stopping me.

141
00:06:43,200 --> 00:06:45,060
If this is the happiness you want,

142
00:06:46,120 --> 00:06:47,280
then take it.

143
00:06:48,120 --> 00:06:49,780
If you won't save Chu Qingyun,

144
00:06:50,240 --> 00:06:50,840
I will.

145
00:06:51,640 --> 00:06:52,900
I don't have much else,

146
00:06:53,720 --> 00:06:54,980
but what I despise most

147
00:06:55,159 --> 00:06:56,220
is the inversion of

148
00:06:56,240 --> 00:06:57,400
black and white in this world,

149
00:06:57,400 --> 00:06:59,930
and good people suffering
baseless slander.

150
00:07:00,720 --> 00:07:01,250
However,

151
00:07:02,480 --> 00:07:03,940
I still want to advise you,

152
00:07:05,520 --> 00:07:07,720
don't end up failing to save Chu Qingyun

153
00:07:07,720 --> 00:07:09,360
and getting yourself killed
in the process.

154
00:07:09,360 --> 00:07:11,890
You don't need to teach me
how to make choices.

155
00:07:12,760 --> 00:07:14,080
This is my role.

156
00:07:15,280 --> 00:07:16,810
You have your way of living,

157
00:07:18,000 --> 00:07:19,080
and I have mine.

158
00:07:30,480 --> 00:07:32,610
Who gave you the painting in your hand?

159
00:07:32,640 --> 00:07:34,000
Who is the mastermind behind this?

160
00:07:34,000 --> 00:07:34,400
Speak!

161
00:07:35,360 --> 00:07:36,520
You want me to speak?

162
00:07:37,040 --> 00:07:37,770
Impossible.

163
00:07:45,960 --> 00:07:46,490
General,

164
00:07:46,840 --> 00:07:47,900
he seems to be dead.

165
00:07:51,280 --> 00:07:52,140
He won't speak.

166
00:07:53,760 --> 00:07:54,620
What about you?

167
00:07:58,880 --> 00:08:00,480
Do you want to end up like him?

168
00:08:04,360 --> 00:08:05,720
I drew that painting

169
00:08:05,720 --> 00:08:06,480
on a whim.

170
00:08:07,480 --> 00:08:08,480
The image of a deer

171
00:08:08,800 --> 00:08:10,660
is often used by northern tribes,

172
00:08:10,720 --> 00:08:11,800
but that doesn't mean

173
00:08:11,800 --> 00:08:12,560
they are the only ones

174
00:08:12,560 --> 00:08:14,020
who know this totem style.

175
00:08:14,240 --> 00:08:15,770
Even if you beat me to death,

176
00:08:16,360 --> 00:08:18,020
I won't confess to this crime.

177
00:08:19,160 --> 00:08:19,690
General,

178
00:08:20,000 --> 00:08:20,600
Second Lady Xue

179
00:08:20,600 --> 00:08:22,730
is asking to see you outside the manor.

180
00:08:26,240 --> 00:08:28,520
Xue Keying really cares about you.

181
00:08:30,640 --> 00:08:32,000
She's not afraid of death

182
00:08:32,000 --> 00:08:33,240
to deliver herself to our door.

183
00:08:33,240 --> 00:08:33,880
Fine,

184
00:08:34,120 --> 00:08:35,520
since you won't speak...

185
00:08:35,640 --> 00:08:36,500
I'll go ask her.

186
00:08:36,559 --> 00:08:37,039
Don't

187
00:08:38,799 --> 00:08:40,640
make things difficult for Miss Keying.

188
00:08:40,640 --> 00:08:41,720
Come at me instead.

189
00:09:00,120 --> 00:09:00,840
You said

190
00:09:01,200 --> 00:09:03,400
the Phoenix Nirvana painting is yours.

191
00:09:04,600 --> 00:09:05,800
Then tell me,

192
00:09:06,760 --> 00:09:08,040
when was it painted?

193
00:09:08,520 --> 00:09:09,480
And the deer totem,

194
00:09:09,480 --> 00:09:10,840
was it painted before

195
00:09:11,360 --> 00:09:12,720
or after?

196
00:09:16,600 --> 00:09:17,800
I found the painting.

197
00:09:19,000 --> 00:09:20,600
But Chu Qingyun is innocent.

198
00:09:21,720 --> 00:09:22,600
Release him.

199
00:09:28,480 --> 00:09:30,140
When Xue Ruowan was poisoned,

200
00:09:30,680 --> 00:09:32,160
you were clearly not the murderer,

201
00:09:32,160 --> 00:09:33,880
yet you insisted you did it.

202
00:09:34,280 --> 00:09:35,640
Now you are risking your life

203
00:09:35,640 --> 00:09:37,080
to take the blame for Chu Qingyun.

204
00:09:37,080 --> 00:09:37,800
Do you enjoy

205
00:09:37,800 --> 00:09:39,040
being a scapegoat so much?

206
00:09:39,040 --> 00:09:40,040
I believe Chu Qingyun

207
00:09:40,040 --> 00:09:41,040
is a good man.

208
00:09:42,000 --> 00:09:42,840
He would never

209
00:09:42,880 --> 00:09:44,200
betray his country for glory.

210
00:09:44,200 --> 00:09:46,000
You once said I was a good man too.

211
00:09:48,360 --> 00:09:49,960
But I am not.

212
00:09:51,280 --> 00:09:53,540
I would rather kill a thousand by mistake

213
00:09:54,040 --> 00:09:55,440
than let one go.

214
00:10:06,800 --> 00:10:07,800
What is this?

215
00:10:11,360 --> 00:10:13,280
I chopped off Chu Qingyun's hand.

216
00:10:13,920 --> 00:10:15,380
He confessed everything.

217
00:10:15,600 --> 00:10:17,240
That painting was done last night.

218
00:10:17,240 --> 00:10:18,700
The ink isn't even dry yet.

219
00:10:18,800 --> 00:10:20,730
Next time before you play the fool,

220
00:10:21,600 --> 00:10:22,280
please

221
00:10:23,120 --> 00:10:24,120
do your homework.

222
00:10:25,640 --> 00:10:27,370
As long as I can achieve my goal,

223
00:10:27,600 --> 00:10:29,160
I can sacrifice anyone.

224
00:10:32,080 --> 00:10:33,240
Including you.

225
00:10:35,200 --> 00:10:37,460
I had an audience with His Majesty today,

226
00:10:37,840 --> 00:10:39,760
and learned
that the General has finally agreed

227
00:10:39,760 --> 00:10:41,840
to fulfill the marriage contract
with Wan'er.

228
00:10:41,840 --> 00:10:43,760
I am finally at ease.

229
00:10:45,160 --> 00:10:46,760
Then, as His Majesty wishes,

230
00:10:47,520 --> 00:10:49,720
the wedding will take place in two days.

231
00:10:49,880 --> 00:10:51,000
I have heard that the General

232
00:10:51,000 --> 00:10:52,440
arrested the palace painter,

233
00:10:52,440 --> 00:10:53,400
Chu Qingyun.

234
00:10:53,920 --> 00:10:56,520
To think he is a spy
from the Northern Frontier.

235
00:11:00,520 --> 00:11:03,080
You are truly well-informed, Duke.

236
00:11:04,120 --> 00:11:04,680
Indeed.

237
00:11:06,000 --> 00:11:07,930
I did indeed find on Chu Qingyun...

238
00:11:08,280 --> 00:11:10,080
We found a special painting

239
00:11:10,360 --> 00:11:13,000
bearing the emblem
of the enemy spy organization.
